From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angel Pons <th3fanbus@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:59:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Haswell NRI: Add Retrain Margin Check

This is a test that measures the eye width/height of the read and write
margins, to ensure they are big enough for proper operation. Currently,
since we do not do any power or performance training, we should have no
problems achieving the minimum margins. However, power optimisation can
trade off margin for power savings, and if it is too aggressive, it may
reduce margins too much for stable operation.

Change-Id: If1685f9ba7ebbb3d09f2350c9e9a86d343fbca46
Signed-off-by: Angel Pons <th3fanbus@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit f96cfb21210c3062a4ffc255c46816ebbab56084)
